OL,3,GNEWSALasting legacy? Ayr to build on
OL,4,ATartan Army's World Cup links with US
OL,5,Astate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe past summer saw thousands of
OL,8,FScotland fans head to America to cheer
OL,9,Fon the national team at the World Cup.
OL,11,FWhile Scotland's games were played in
OL,12,FBoston and Miami, many Scots based
OL,13,Fthemselves elsewhere - with about 5,000
OL,14,Fstaying in Providence, Rhode Island.
OL,16,FNow one region could wind up with
OL,17,Fcloser links Stateside as a result.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
