OL,3,GNEWSALasting legacy? Ayr to build on
OL,4,ATartan Army's World Cup links with US
OL,5,Astate
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Ayrshire councillors last week
OL,8,Funanimously backed an application by
OL,9,Fthe Ayr-Providence Friendship
OL,10,FInitiative (APFI) that hopes to set up
OL,11,Fa formal friendship agreement between
OL,12,FAyr and Providence, the state capital
OL,13,Fof America's smallest state.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
